<title>FRANCE: EU sells 10,493 tonnes of German intervention rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells 10,493 tonnes of German intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 10,493 tonnes of German intervention rye at a minimum price of 95.08 Ecus per tonne for export to countries outside the EU, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
